<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms' profits growth rate down.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms' profits growth rate down.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A study of the top 5,000 Philippine companies showed aggregate profits grew by just 8.9 percent in 1995 compared to a growth rate of 69.1 percent in 1994, the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) said on Friday.</p>
</text>
